@startuml Benchmark_Sequence_Diagram_B
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor User #lightgreen
participant "Orchestrator" as Orchestrator #lightyellow
participant "Config\nDetector" as ConfigDetector #thistle
participant "Analyzer" as Analyzer #pink
participant "Comparative\nOrchestrator" as ComparativeOrchestrator #lightsteelblue
participant "Report/Export\nService" as ReportService #lightgray

title BRISE Benchmark - B: Analysis (Slide View)

== Analysis Handoff ==
Orchestrator -> ConfigDetector: **Detect + load benchmark config**
ConfigDetector -->> Orchestrator: config + comparative flag
Orchestrator -> Analyzer: **Run analysis**
activate Analyzer

Analyzer -> Analyzer: **Load dumps and exclude selected baselines**
Analyzer -> Analyzer: **Partition by objective / problem instance**
Analyzer -> Analyzer: **Build plots and summary tables**
note right of Analyzer
  Uses grouping, normalization,
  and known-optimum overlays.
end note

opt Comparative metrics enabled
  Analyzer -> ComparativeOrchestrator: **Compute NI / regret / profile data**
  ComparativeOrchestrator -->> Analyzer: comparative results
end

Analyzer -> ReportService: **Build report + export CSV/ZIP**
ReportService -->> Analyzer: HTML report + download artifacts
Analyzer -> User: **Open report**
deactivate Analyzer

@enduml



